rs by increasing hysteresis. This improves stability but can delay cell changes.\", \"entry_point\": \"xapp_stability_guard\", \"execution_type\": \"periodic\", \"control_parameters\": \"handover.hysteresisOffset_dB\", \"kpi_objectives\": {}, \"kpi_constraints\": {}, \"expected_standalone_effect\": {}, \"path\": \"/Users/kilobao/Documents/MATLAB/Examples/R2025b/5g/5GORAN/oran-sim/xapps/xapp_stability_guard\", \"status\": \"off\"}, {\"xapp_id\": \"xapp_throughput_maximizer\", \"name\": \"Throughput Maximizer xApp\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"Maximizes throughput by selecting high-utility UEs and adaptively boosting bandwidth and power when PRB is saturated and SINR is low. Soft caps limit drop and BLER growth.\", \"entry_point\": \"xapp_throughput_maximizer\", \"execution_type\": \"periodic\", \"control_parameters\": [\"scheduling.selectedUE\", \"radio.bandwidthScale\", \"radio.txPowerOffset_dB\"], \"kpi_objectives\": {}, \"kpi_constraints\": {}, \"expected_standalone_effect\": {}, \"path\": \"/Users/kilobao/Documents/MATLAB/Examples/R2025b/5g/5GORAN/oran-sim/xapps/xapp_throughput_maximizer\", \"status\": \"off\"}]\n\nreasoning需为简短中文理由，不要包含多余格式。\nkpi_focus请填写与意图相关的KPI名称列表。\n请严格输出JSON。",
